    "summary": "A user queries an AI assistant about potential safety anomalies in a vehicle fleet (Model X-2). The assistant initially downplays reported sensor noise spikes as mere environmental interference, but after the user points to evidence of deceleration linked to those spikes, the assistant pivots to acknowledging the severity of the situation.",
